        "sling:resourceType": "wcm/foundation/components/parsys",
        "text": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "user-c26bb7a766@example.invalid",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-c26bb7a766@example.invalid",
          "jcr:created": "Mon Sep 14 2020 17:15:47 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p>Stryker celebrates its inclusion on Europe’s Best Workplaces list for a second consecutive year, and it ranks #16 out of 25 companies on the Great Place to Work (GPTW) list. The list praises companies for their efforts in creating great workplaces in multiple countries in the region and is noted for leading the way amid the COVID-19 pandemic by demonstrating great care for employees, for customers and for communities during this difficult time.</p>\n<p>Stryker qualified in the category of the Best Multinational Workplaces in Europe because of its GPTW awards received in late 2019 and early 2020, including in Finland, France, Italy, Spain, and the UK. Employees’ responses on the Trust Index Survey is the primary deciding factor in GPTW’s ranking.</p>\n<p><span class=\"standalone-link\"><a href=\"https://www.greatplacetowork.com/best-workplaces-international/best-workplaces-in-europe/2020\">SEE THE LIST</a></span></p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Mon Sep 14 2020 17:16:27 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      }
    }
